{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"The code now uses `material_clean` to judge whether a base validated its recorded head, rather than rejecting every unavailable spec binding. I’m checking that cleanliness witness, selection, and cancellation together. The two documented gaps—report provenance and end-to-end closeout coverage—remain visible in the source and spec."}}
